✅ Binary Search
✅ Sliding Window
 
Tier 2 (Strong Command)
✅ Backtracking
✅ Heap
✅ Linked List
✅ Greedy
✅ Arrays
 
Tier 3 (Need Exposure)
✅ Trie
✅ Union Find
✅ Bit Manipulation
✅ Monotonic Stack
 
Tier 4 (Advanced)
✅ Segment Tree
✅ Fenwick Tree
✅ Advanced Graphs
✅ Advanced DP
✅ Sweep Line
✅ Computational Geometry

